If you run with Docker Compose (recommended for your setup), rebuild and restart backend + frontend:

docker compose down
docker compose build --no-cache loklingo-backend loklingo-frontend
docker compose up -d
docker compose logs -f loklingo-backend


If you run dev overlay:

docker compose -f docker-compose.yml -f docker-compose.dev.yml down
docker compose -f docker-compose.yml -f docker-compose.dev.yml build --no-cache loklingo-backend loklingo-frontend
docker compose -f docker-compose.yml -f docker-compose.dev.yml up -d
docker compose -f docker-compose.yml -f docker-compose.dev.yml logs -f loklingo-backend


Quick verify OCR service + backend readiness:

curl -s http://localhost:8000/health | jq
curl -s http://localhost:8080/ready | jq


Quick verify image OCR endpoint (replace with a real local image path):

curl -s -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/translate/image \
  -F "file=@/absolute/path/to/test.png" \
  -F "source=auto" \
  -F "target=en" \
  -F "mode=ocr_only" | jq


If you run frontend dev server, restart it too:

cd /home/sameer/Public/Shared/Work/Projects/LokLingo/frontend
rm -rf node_modules/.vite
npm run dev

Then do a hard reload in browser: Ctrl+Shift+R.










