Hardening increment (write endpoint authentication)

Backend:
- Added write-route auth middleware for:
  - `POST /api/v1/translate`
  - `POST /api/v1/translate/image`
  - `POST /api/v1/jobs`
  - `POST /api/v1/jobs/pdf`
  - `POST /api/v1/jobs/image`
- Auth supports either `X-API-Token` or `Authorization: Bearer <token>`.
- Added production config guard: `WRITE_API_TOKEN` is now required when `APP_ENV=production`.

Ops/docs:
- Added `WRITE_API_TOKEN` to `.env.example`, `.env.development`, and `.env.production`.
- README updated with write-route auth usage.

