Hardening increment (route-specific rate + concurrency controls)

Backend:
- Added route-tiered rate limiters:
  - global limiter for non-health routes
  - stricter write-route limiter
  - strictest limiter for upload-heavy routes (`/translate/image`, `/jobs/pdf`, `/jobs/image`)
- Added in-flight concurrency gate for sync image endpoint (`POST /api/v1/translate/image`).
- New config/env controls:
  - `GLOBAL_RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE`
  - `WRITE_RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE`
  - `UPLOAD_RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE`
  - `SYNC_IMAGE_MAX_INFLIGHT`

