---

Hardening increment (job retry metadata + dead-letter flow)

Backend:
- Added async job retry/dead-letter metadata fields on job state:
  - `attempt`, `max_attempts`, `last_error`, `next_retry_at`, `dead_lettered_at`
- Added delayed retry queue support in Redis:
  - transient failures are requeued with exponential backoff via `loklingo:jobs:retry:zset`
  - due retries are promoted back into the active queue during dequeue
- Added terminal dead-letter flow in Redis:
  - exhausted/non-retryable failures are recorded in `loklingo:jobs:dead:queue`
  - failure reasons persisted in `loklingo:jobs:dead:meta`
- Worker loop now handles failed jobs centrally:
  - retry transient errors until max attempts
  - dead-letter on exhaustion/non-retryable errors

Tests:
- Added worker tests for:
  - retry scheduling on transient failure
  - dead-letter transition after max attempts

Validation status:
- backend: go test ./...
- All green after retry/dead-letter hardening changes.

